From: Andrew Morton <akpm@linux-foundation.org>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 15:35:01 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] MAINTAINERS: sort component entries alphabetically

Move the 18 renamed MM component entries alongside the existing MEMORY
MANAGEMENT entries, placing them according to their new headings.

Preserve every entry's contents and internal line order.  Leave all
other entries in their existing relative order.

Signed-off-by: Andrew Morton <akpm@linux-foundation.org>
